<Layout title="AI-Native Organization Program" description="Scale proven human-and-AI workflow patterns across teams with reusable infrastructure, governance, capability-building, and business-outcome measurement.">
  <PageHero label="Scale the model — custom scope" title='Turn one working workflow into an <span class="text-ms-green-400">organizational capability.</span>' subtitle="Scale proven patterns across teams without turning AI into a disconnected zoo of pilots." />
  <section class="bg-ms-dark-800 border-y border-white/5"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16"><div><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">The goal is not maximum automation.</h2><p class="mt-6 text-lg text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">The goal is a better organization: faster where speed matters, more thoughtful where judgment matters, and able to improve as technology and work change.</p></div><div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300"><p>→ Reusable agent and knowledge infrastructure</p><p>→ Governance and decision rights</p><p>→ Team capability and delivery standards</p><p>→ Workflow portfolio tied to business outcomes</p><p>→ Measurement across speed, quality, cost, and value</p></div></div></section>
  <CTA />
</Layout>
